ion-0569\",\"source_markdown\":\"SLR/SLR1/pdfs/citation-reports/citation-report-0569/citation-report-0569.md\",\"section\":\"2 Requirements management in small space enterprises: problems and needs\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[4,5],\"evidence_id\":\"VS-E09\"},{\"source_id\":\"citation-0569\",\"source_markdown\":\"SLR/SLR1/pdfs/citation-reports/citation-report-0569/citation-report-0569.md\",\"section\":\"3 Software for requirement management: overview and proposal, Table 1\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[5,6],\"evidence_id\":\"VS-E09\"}],\"verification_id\":\"V04\",\"verification_status\":\"planned, not executed\",\"verification_method\":\"T\",\"proposed_acceptance\":\"Compare both query directions with the fixture relation set. Missing, ambiguous and stale endpoints remain visible.\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Implement cross-store relation semantics and bidirectional queries beyond tree comparison.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"The index is a projection. Valispace owns requirements/decisions, Capella owns topology and the archive resolves exact accepted revisions.\",\"procedure_performers\":[\"Systems Engineer\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"VS-HOST-VALI\",\"VS-HOST-ENG\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"VS-HOST-VALI\",\"VS-HOST-STORE\"],\"interface_family_ids\":[\"IF-01\",\"IF-06\"],\"mission_need_ids\":[\"MN-02\",\"MN-10\"],\"mission_requirement_ids\":[\"MR-02\",\"MR-10\"]}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
