an unqualified supported or verified status.\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Implement the distinct evidence states and criticality gate instead of relying on a native test-status field alone.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"Author status, admissibility verdict, review outcome and external approval remain distinct.\",\"procedure_performers\":[\"Systems Engineer\",\"EPS Engineer\",\"Independent reviewer or reproducer (a distinct task role)\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"VS-HOST-VALI\",\"VS-HOST-ENG\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"VS-HOST-VALI\",\"VS-HOST-STORE\"],\"interface_family_ids\":[\"IF-01\",\"IF-06\"],\"mission_need_ids\":[\"MN-02\",\"MN-05\",\"MN-10\"],\"mission_requirement_ids\":[\"MR-02\",\"MR-05\",\"MR-10\"]}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
