3.1 DDSE-MBSE approach, Table 3.2\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[46,47],\"evidence_id\":\"VS-E06\"},{\"source_id\":\"citation-4690\",\"source_markdown\":\"SLR/SLR1/pdfs/citation-reports/citation-report-4690/citation-report-4690.md\",\"section\":\"3.3 Python for Capella\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[51,52],\"evidence_id\":\"VS-E06\"},{\"source_id\":\"citation-4690\",\"source_markdown\":\"SLR/SLR1/pdfs/citation-reports/citation-report-4690/citation-report-4690.md\",\"section\":\"Conclusions\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[90,91],\"evidence_id\":\"VS-E06\"}],\"verification_id\":\"V37\",\"verification_status\":\"planned, not executed\",\"verification_method\":\"I,D\",\"proposed_acceptance\":\"Compare generated views with a fixture model and apply a declared reviewer task checklist. Assess correctness and readability without proliferating requirement, measure, scenario or state diagrams.\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Implement filtering/export provenance and reviewer readability task. Existing diagrams do not prove correct or readable generated packages.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"Views are derived projections. This allocation adds no new report diagrams and requires no native Valispace SysML support.\",\"procedure_performers\":[\"EPS Engineer\",\"Systems Engineer\",\"Independent reviewer or reproducer (a distinct task role)\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"VS-HOST-VALI\",\"VS-HOST-ENG\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"VS-HOST-STORE\",\"VS-HOST-VALI\"],\"interface_family_ids\":[\"IF-06\",\"IF-01\"],\"mission_need_ids\":[\"MN-10\"],\"mission_requirement_ids\":[\"MR-10\"]}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
