eports/citation-report-0569/citation-report-0569.md\",\"section\":\"2 Requirements management in small space enterprises: problems and needs\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[4,5],\"evidence_id\":\"VS-E09\"},{\"source_id\":\"citation-0569\",\"source_markdown\":\"SLR/SLR1/pdfs/citation-reports/citation-report-0569/citation-report-0569.md\",\"section\":\"3 Software for requirement management: overview and proposal, Table 1\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[5,6],\"evidence_id\":\"VS-E09\"}],\"verification_id\":\"V39\",\"verification_status\":\"planned, not executed\",\"verification_method\":\"I,D\",\"proposed_acceptance\":\"Demonstrate the minimum workflow from a clean declared environment. Record wall-clock time separately from active person-hours and state the cost period and inclusions. Unknown cost stays unknown.\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Produce and trial clean-start package. Current license/user/API/export terms, versions and actual resource/cost/effort observations remain open.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"Licensed access establishes no infeasibility without real budget evidence. Framework costs remain separate from EPS acquisition and research deliverable assessment.\",\"procedure_performers\":[\"Project Manager\",\"Systems Engineer\",\"Independent reviewer or reproducer (a distinct task role)\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"VS-HOST-ENG\",\"VS-HOST-VALI\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"VS-HOST-STORE\",\"VS-HOST-VALI\"],\"interface_family_ids\":[\"IF-01\",\"IF-06\"],\"mission_need_ids\":[\"MN-11\",\"MN-09\"],\"mission_requirement_ids\":[\"MR-11\",\"MR-09\"]}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
